    <li><strong>Data and reporting:</strong> Advanced Excel (pivot tables, XLOOKUP, data modelling) and Power BI; Python for workflow automation and analysis (Pandas, NumPy, Plotly).</li>
    <li><strong>Platforms:</strong> SaaS CRM systems, Asana (AI task automation, workflow design).</li>
    <li><strong>Cloud (AWS):</strong> Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB, Cognito, S3, CloudFront, IAM.</li>
  </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="row">
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <div>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Bachelor of Social Science (Hons), Economics</strong> · 2021. Rhodes University, South Africa. First Class Honours; Dean's List; Academic Half Colours.</li>
    <li><strong>Bachelor of Social Science, Economics and Industrial Psychology</strong> · 2016 to 2020. Rhodes University, South Africa. First Class.</li>
  </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
